{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "file:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_compiler.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "cmsis_compiler.h",
      "filePath": "Drivers/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_compiler.h",
      "summary": "CMSIS 编译器抽象头文件，统一 ARMCC、armclang、GCC、IAR 等工具链的编译器特定关键字（内联、对齐、段属性、中断限定符）。被所有 core_*.h 包含，是 CMSIS 内核头的可移植基础。",
      "tags": ["cmsis", "compiler-abstraction", "header", "boilerplate"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "纯预处理器宏聚合，按 __ICCARM__/__clang__/__GNUC__ 等宏分支选择工具链定义，无任何运行时代码。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_version.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "cmsis_version.h",
      "filePath": "Drivers/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_version.h",
      "summary": "CMSIS 版本号定义头文件，仅声明 __CM_CMSIS_VERSION 与 __CMSIS_DEVICE_VERSION 等宏，供内核与设备头校验版本一致性。",
      "tags": ["cmsis", "version", "header", "boilerplate"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/core_cm7.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "core_cm7.h",
      "filePath": "Drivers/CMSIS/Include/core_cm7.h",
      "summary": "CMSIS Cortex-M7 内核外设访问层（CPAL）头文件，提供 NVIC 中断控制、SCB 系统控制、Cache 维护（I/D Cache）、FPU 检测与 ITM 调试等内联函数。本飞控 MCU 为 STM32F722RETx（Cortex-M7 @216MHz），此文件是实际被编译使用的内核头。",
      "tags": ["cmsis", "cortex-m7", "kernel-header", "nvim", "cache", "boilerplate"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Cortex-M7 专属，包含 I/D Cache 维护原语（SCB_EnableDCache、SCB_CleanInvalidateDCache_by_Addr 等），这些函数在本固件 main.c 的 Cache 初始化中被调用；其余 core_*.h 为同系列其他内核的 CMSIS 变体，本项目不实际编译。"
    },
    {
